(7181118, 1103352, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ain''t that the truth. This looks like it was taken on the Cape :)</td>', 'Ain''t that the truth. This looks like it was taken on the Cape :)', '2014-02-25 11:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181137, 1103491, 118154, '<td valign="top">They look to real for realism.</td>', 'They look to real for realism.', '2014-02-25 12:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181196, 1103315, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific rhythm of lines, shapes, color and perspective. Concurrently closed in and airy.  What is special here is that all this is in service to making art of atomic weaponry.  Onward to the stars, indeed.  My favorite in the challenge.  The politics are implicit.</td>', 'Terrific rhythm of lines, shapes, color and perspective. Concurrently closed in and airy.  What is special here is that all this is in service to making art of atomic weaponry.  Onward to the stars, indeed.  My favorite in the challenge.  The politics are implicit.', '2014-02-25 14:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181202, 1103562, 173844, '<td valign="top">Ground level politics.  It''s this man''s gaze that provides commentary... numbness, alienation, indifference, if I may supply interpretation.  Nice shiny car nosing into this grungy, workaday environment.  (by "grungy" I mean technique)  Fine take on the disconnection between citizen and politician.  My second favorite.</td>', 'Ground level politics.  It''s this man''s gaze that provides commentary... numbness, alienation, indifference, if I may supply interpretation.  Nice shiny car nosing into this grungy, workaday environment.  (by "grungy" I mean technique)  Fine take on the disconnection between citizen and politician.  My second favorite.', '2014-02-25 14:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181211, 1103586, 173844, '<td valign="top">Mortifying directness here.  It''s like being compelled to look at a car accident.  Vicious teeth, glittery exterior and glazed, misdirected eye.  Sharp commentary.  This really fills the frame well.  Reminds me of Michael Dukakis'' telling Greek proverb referring to Ronald Reagan, "the fish starts to rot from the head."</td>', 'Mortifying directness here.  It''s like being compelled to look at a car accident.  Vicious teeth, glittery exterior and glazed, misdirected eye.  Sharp commentary.  This really fills the frame well.  Reminds me of Michael Dukakis'' telling Greek proverb referring to Ronald Reagan, "the fish starts to rot from the head."', '2014-02-25 14:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181431, 1103195, 144365, '<td valign="top">Love this entry. <br/>Unfortunately I don''t think it''ll ribbon, but it won''t be from lack of effort on my part.</td>', 'Love this entry. Unfortunately I don''t think it''ll ribbon, but it won''t be from lack of effort on my part.', '2014-02-25 21:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181434, 1103561, 144365, '<td valign="top">Excellent job on the composition.<br/>If it wasn''t for the extremely well positioned eye of the child, this would be a run of the mill photo that I wouldn''t give two shits about. That perfect triangle formed from the three eyes is just too good not to reward.<br/> <br/>Gave this a nine as there''s one entry I like better.</td>', 'Excellent job on the composition.If it wasn''t for the extremely well positioned eye of the child, this would be a run of the mill photo that I wouldn''t give two shits about. That perfect triangle formed from the three eyes is just too good not to reward. Gave this a nine as there''s one entry I like better.', '2014-02-25 21:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181718, 1103005, 159196, '<td valign="top">Aptly named!</td>', 'Aptly named!', '2014-02-26 09:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181722, 1103413, 159196, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites!</td>', 'One of my favorites!', '2014-02-26 09:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181724, 1103653, 159196, '<td valign="top">In my top 3</td>', 'In my top 3', '2014-02-26 09:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181725, 1103510, 159196, '<td valign="top">Good title and I like how they''re all facing in different directions - in my top 3</td>', 'Good title and I like how they''re all facing in different directions - in my top 3', '2014-02-26 09:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181726, 1103573, 159196, '<td valign="top">Great marriage of subject and title</td>', 'Great marriage of subject and title', '2014-02-26 09:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181784, 1103672, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot of the grandiose facade of City Hall.  Solid, imposing if not quite welcoming.  My take on the title is "business as usual."  What I also discern is that it''s, in fact, just a grandiose facade.  Cynically speaking,  behind it all are self-serving, greedy, hypocritical, venal.... business as usual politicians/scurvy knaves.</td>', 'Very nice shot of the grandiose facade of City Hall.  Solid, imposing if not quite welcoming.  My take on the title is "business as usual."  What I also discern is that it''s, in fact, just a grandiose facade.  Cynically speaking,  behind it all are self-serving, greedy, hypocritical, venal.... business as usual politicians/scurvy knaves.', '2014-02-26 12:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181785, 1103352, 173844, '<td valign="top">The image is charming and the title is insightful and cogent.  A long look at this half-gone boat is encouraged by its foreground placement and its lighting,  as if highlighted by sunlight on an overcast day.  I like the way the vignette enhances this impression.  As for the sad truth of the title, I  can''t, fortunately for all, bear to get started.</td>', 'The image is charming and the title is insightful and cogent.  A long look at this half-gone boat is encouraged by its foreground placement and its lighting,  as if highlighted by sunlight on an overcast day.  I like the way the vignette enhances this impression.  As for the sad truth of the title, I  can''t, fortunately for all, bear to get started.', '2014-02-26 13:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181790, 1103651, 173844, '<td valign="top">Exciting juxtaposition of the persistence and inertia of entrenched power, exemplified by the building on the right, and the otherwise modern world, exemplified by the jumpy patterns to the left.  This is a particularly fine example of the old/new juxtaposition.  The composition of the new buildings is balanced and interesting.  Still, can''t say I''m impressed by this version of modernity.</td>', 'Exciting juxtaposition of the persistence and inertia of entrenched power, exemplified by the building on the right, and the otherwise modern world, exemplified by the jumpy patterns to the left.  This is a particularly fine example of the old/new juxtaposition.  The composition of the new buildings is balanced and interesting.  Still, can''t say I''m impressed by this version of modernity.', '2014-02-26 13:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7182156, 1103573, 173844, '<td valign="top">Succinct depiction of the predatory nature of politics behind the camouflage.  Nicely caught prayer posture, further underlining the sanctimonious attitude in which some politicians cloak themselves.  I also like that the mantis is kind of half lit, ready to pull back into the shadows.</td>', 'Succinct depiction of the predatory nature of politics behind the camouflage.  Nicely caught prayer posture, further underlining the sanctimonious attitude in which some politicians cloak themselves.  I also like that the mantis is kind of half lit, ready to pull back into the shadows.', '2014-02-27 11:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7182172, 1103010, 124815, '<td valign="top">Hope you post this in a larger size also. <br/>Congrats for the way you approached the challenge topic, the props, the models, the tonality it''s enjoyable and highly professional. <br/>I see it as part of a cycle more than in itself. I''d like you to continue with the sketched intention of this shot and add more humor or drama or contrast. Make a Marie Antoinette folder, add a few Mary Sturats or consorts of Henry VIII ...</td>', 'Hope you post this in a larger size also. Congrats for the way you approached the challenge topic, the props, the models, the tonality it''s enjoyable and highly professional. I see it as part of a cycle more than in itself. I''d like you to continue with the sketched intention of this shot and add more humor or drama or contrast. Make a Marie Antoinette folder, add a few Mary Sturats or consorts of Henry VIII ...', '2014-02-27 12:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7182173, 1103428, 124815, '<td valign="top">good point - plus ça change, plus c''est la même chose (the more that changes, the more it''s the same thing)</td>', 'good point - plus ça change, plus c''est la même chose (the more that changes, the more it''s the same thing)', '2014-02-27 12:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
